{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basement is a\u00a0psychological, narrative horror experience. Where you play as an young girl, who took a new job in the new city and took a house for rent. But to her surprise\u00a0 the house has dark\u00a0 secrets hidden in it. You encounter lot of horror elements, while discovering what happened in the house in this mystery, thriller, horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/Screenshot__23_.png?t=1742709349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Play:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1.\u00a0 This is a first person experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/Screenshot__45_.png?t=1742709349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Explore the entire house, while encountering the horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/Screenshot__31_.png?t=1742709349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Find out what happened in the house, and why the house is haunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/extras/Screenshot__27_.png?t=1742709349\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Free the house from the demonic possession.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581150?t=1742709349","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581150/a903dca3e1fc15cf4a67ce1ba67f568520523a2c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742709349","capsule_i